  (text "PSU-B: 9-36 V vehicle input -> 5.28 V, plug-on board for the hour-meter main board (J102)\nTPS54360B 4.5-60 V buck, based on TI SNVSB93 Figure 32 (5 V / 600 kHz reference design)\nfsw ~600 kHz (RT 162k); Vout = 0.8 x (1 + 56k/10k) = 5.28 V (main board OR-diode leaves ~4.9 V)\nUVLO: start 8.05 V, stop 6.31 V (R1 510k / R2 82k; EN = 8.0 V at the 58 V TVS clamp, abs max 8.4 V)\nCompensation Type 2A: 13k + 6.8 nF, 39 pF (TI reference values); check the load step at bring-up (X5R caps lose C at 5.3 V)\nInput: SMBJ36CA bidirectional TVS (36 V standoff, ~58 V clamp) before SS510 reverse-polarity diode; 100 uF/63 V bulk\nP1 pinout (180-degree safe): 1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 VOUT, 4 VOUT, 5 GND, 6 VIN"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "26418d11-2992-49bd-8e68-cf8593b9fda9")
  )
